# Titan 2 Elite hardware keyboard: letters, held Shift and Alt chords, Enter.
# Requires auto-capitalization of the first letter disabled; capitalization after a period
# (default on) capitalizes the letter after "!" and Enter.
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout qwerty
hw type "hello "
hw hold SHIFT_RIGHT
hw press W
hw release SHIFT_RIGHT
hw type orld
hw hold ALT_LEFT
hw press B
hw release ALT_LEFT
expect "hello World!"
hw type "\nx 1"
expect "hello World!\nX 1"
